      "writtenOn": "2024-08-09T09:39:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "don\u0027t we need an annotation that the case fallthrough is intentional?\n\nSome kernel configs have -Wimplicit-fallthrough enabled (or perhaps that\u0027s the default now?). See: https://lore.kernel.org/lkml/20210304225202.GB105908@embeddedor/T/",
      "range": {
