      "writtenOn": "2024-08-12T01:14:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I didn\u0027t get any error building. From my understanding, this is not considered a fallthrough, as all cases have a `break`. The fact that there are 2 \u0027case\u0027 for a block is not the same.\n\nI did try to remove the break above for testing, and it did trigger the \"fallthrough\" build error you mentioned. So if there was an issue with the current code, I assume something would have been raised.",
